    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "1504902",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "150351001",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Man, staying in the Abyss feels so surreal, don't you think?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "150351002",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "No day, and no night — it's like time hardly exists. If we weren't careful to keep track, it feels like we'd have no idea how long we've even been here."
                },
                {
                    "id": "150351003",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Well, except for the fact that Paimon still gets hungry like clockwork... You go do your training. Paimon's gonna grab a bite."
                },
                {
                    "id": "150351004",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I'm ready to start."
                },
                {
                    "id": "150351005",
                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                    "text": "The way I see it, the pursuit of power is divided into three stages."
                },
                {
                    "id": "150351006",
                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                    "text": "The first is mastering the use of standard weapons. Next is learning how to harness natural energy. And, after that, you're free to challenge even higher dimensions."
                },
                {
                    "id": "150351007",
                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                    "text": "The \"natural energy\" of Teyvat is, of course, elemental energy. But that's not my area of expertise — I draw from a different source of power.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "150351008",
                            "text": "A different source of power?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "150351010",
                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                    "text": "Abyssal power, yes. Also known as the power of the Void Realm."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "150351011",
                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                    "text": "My master, Surtalogi, is a true expert in that area. After all, he was one of the group of five that infamously stole the all-encompassing power of the Abyss, an act for which the people of Khaenri'ah gave them the epithet \"The Five Sinners.\""
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "150351012",
                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                    "text": "The elemental energy of Teyvat, on the other hand, is derived from the power of the Light Realm. These two forms of energy exist in direct opposition to each other. Suffice to say, there's not much I can teach you this time.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "150351013",
                                            "text": "But, there's something familiar about the power you use.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351015",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "#A keen observation, {NICKNAME}."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351016",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "Call it... respecting local norms. The Abyss stands in direct conflict with the will of this world. So, to make my life easier, I disguise my power to make it appear Cryo-like in nature."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351017",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "It's a technique I learned from some Khaenri'ahn ruins, known as \"the Seven-Shifting Serpent.\" If you ever change your mind about delving into Abyssal power, I can teach it to you.",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "150351018",
                                                            "text": "Abyssal power doesn't suit me...",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150351020",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "So I've heard. You seem to have a knack for removing Abyssal power."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150351021",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "But... Is \"purification\" really what's going on there? Like I said — power does not simply disappear."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150351022",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "What are you trying to say?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150351023",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "...Just thinking out loud. Let's focus on your elemental training. That's what's gonna help us if the situation gets tricky."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150351024",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "True growth comes from adversity. But only if you make the choice to pick yourself up again every time you fall."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150351025",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "So, it's time to push yourself to the limit — and then keep pushing. This is the only way to advance at pace."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "150351019",
                                                            "text": "I have the ability to purify Abyssal power."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "150351014",
                                            "text": "It almost seems related to Cryo in some way."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "150351009",
                            "text": "That must mean..."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "1504903",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "150351901",
                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                    "text": "From your training so far, you have gained a better command of the sword and more control over your elemental abilities.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "150351902",
                            "text": "Thank you.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "150351904",
                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                    "text": "That's only part of it. Experience is the real teacher. Your journey, the friends you have made, the dangers you have faced — these have taught you more than I ever could."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "150351905",
                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                    "text": "Now, it's time to focus on how you react under pressure. You must be able to think rationally, even in unpredictable combat situations. To simulate this, I'm going to attack, and you're going to block."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "150351906",
                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                    "text": "Ready?",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "150351907",
                                            "text": "Yes.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351909",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "Hm, not bad. That defensive stance looks near unbreakable."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351910",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "#Just like your {M#sister}{F#brother}. Ah, that reminds me. You still don't know what happened to {M#her}{F#him}, do you..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351911",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "!!!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351912",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "Oh..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351913",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Hey, no fair! That's cheating!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351914",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "You think every opponent has the same moral code as you? You can denounce their deplorable methods all you want... But, only if you live to tell the tale. The dead don't get to complain."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351915",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "Strong emotions will always arise in combat — anxiety, anger, fear — but a true warrior is never at their whim. Only when you are free from the influence of emotion can you make the right choice no matter the situation."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351916",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "Are you describing yourself?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351917",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "How amusing. Almost sounds like you think you know me."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351918",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "...But, you don't. You can choose your own path — we are not the same."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351919",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "Let's begin. Try to use reason over emotion. Make the most rational and advantageous decision in any given moment."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150351920",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "This is your final training session. Look alive."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "150351908",
                                            "text": "Give me your worst."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "150351903",
                            "text": "It's all thanks to your guidance."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "1504904",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "150352701",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "(Huh...)"
                },
                {
                    "id": "150352702",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "(The dream is over. I can hear the crackling of a fire in the distance, and there's a fragrant aroma in the air... Mmm, grilled meat...)"
                },
                {
                    "id": "150352703",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "You're awake!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "150352704",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "You must be starving, right? Ta-da! A barbecue feast just for you!",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "150352705",
                            "text": "I am a little hungry.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "150352707",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Hehehe, of course you are! That's why Skirk and Paimon got this all ready for you. Dig in, before it gets cold!",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "150352708",
                                            "text": "You two...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150352710",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Eh, well, if you're around someone long enough, it's bound to happen. Plus, Skirk can cook! So, Paimon decided she can forgive the whole \"ice queen\" thing. Paimon's not one to hold a grudge..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150352711",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "Here's an idea. Let's save the chit-chat until after the meal."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150352712",
                                                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                                    "text": "You all dig in and make quick work of the food."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150352713",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Oof... So full..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150352714",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Okay, it's Paimon's turn to sleep now. Wake her up when it's time to go!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150352715",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "I have good news."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150352716",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "First, your training is complete — you have what it takes to wield immense power, now it's just a matter of putting it into practice. Continue to learn from your journey and hone your skills against formidable opponents."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "150352717",
                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                    "text": "Second, I've located the culprit we've been searching for. Next, we just need to retrieve the missing part of your soul, and our business will be concluded.",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "150352718",
                                                            "text": "Thank you...",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352720",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "When Ajax trained with me, he once told me he was \"bursting with questions.\" So, I allowed him to ask me three of them before he left."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352721",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "#You and I may never meet again, {NICKNAME}. So if there's anything you want to ask me, now's your opportunity. Just like Ajax, I'll answer three of your questions."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352722",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(After spending time in Skirk's inner world and witnessing her memories, there are so many questions I could ask. But, the most important one is...)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352723",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "Are you... really from Teyvat?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352724",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "...Okay, not the angle I was expecting. What makes you ask that?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352725",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "I'm sorry I didn't tell you earlier, but... while we were dream-mirroring, I think I saw your memories."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352726",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "...?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352727",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(This is the first time I've seen Skirk break her composure. I guess this really took her by surprise.)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352728",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "I knew that was a possible side-effect... Closed off my mind to you for that exact reason."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352729",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Even with the dream-mirroring, you should have seen nothing but endless darkness."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352730",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(So, Skirk didn't share those memories with me on purpose. And in fact, she tried her best to keep them from me.)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352731",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(Wait, speaking of endless darkness... On my first time there, that was all I saw — until that strange creature appeared...)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352732",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Eh, whatever. Must have been a flaw in my execution... I shouldn't be too surprised. Due to some recent circumstances, my self-control has been lacking as of late."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352733",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Since you've seen what you've seen, there's no reason to hide the truth. All I ask is that you keep it a secret."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352734",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "No, I'm not from Teyvat. I'm from a different planet, and there was a time when I journeyed through the stars — a lot like you, in some ways."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352735",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "Like me? Do you mean... you're also a Descender?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352736",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "No, we're different in that respect. You're influencing the fate of this world, but me? I'm just passing through."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352737",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Several hundred years ago, my master, Surtalogi, opened the border between worlds and sent me here."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352738",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "But, this is not my home, and one day, I'll return to the vast unknown of space... So, there you have it. Onto your second question."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352739",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "What is your goal in coming here?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352740",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "To become stronger."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352741",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "For certain reasons, I need to bridge the power gap between me and my master as quickly as possible. But, first, I need to understand the source of his strength."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352742",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "To do that, I need to follow in his footsteps, walk the path he once walked. And somewhere along the way, I'll find out how to defeat him. That is my sole focus and purpose."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352743",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "...Okay, you have one question remaining."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352744",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(Skirk's goal is to defeat \"The Foul\"? I can hear how serious this is for her. I wonder what those \"certain reasons\" could be...)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352745",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(But, given how quickly she blazed through that answer, I doubt she wants to talk about it. I have one question left. What should I ask?)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352746",
                                                                    "speaker": "Childe",
                                                                    "text": "You make it sound so easy. Ever since the incident I experienced there, I've never stopped searching for Master Skirk and that unknown abyss."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352747",
                                                                    "speaker": "Childe",
                                                                    "text": "But it's been years now and I've still found nothing..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352748",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(Huh... Maybe I should take this opportunity to get Childe some answers.)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352749",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Well? Your last question?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352750",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "You know Childe is looking for you, right? Are you going to let him see you?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352751",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Ajax..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352752",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "His situation is different than yours. Before you ever crossed paths with me, you'd already encountered many formidable people, studied their techniques, and developed your own skillset."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352753",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "So, during your training, all I had to do was build upon that foundation. But, Ajax was so young when he came to me — a complete blank canvas."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352754",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Children can't help but imitate their role models. In the long run, that would only hinder his growth."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352755",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Once Ajax has enough strength in his own right, I will allow us to meet again. Until then, let that motivate him to reach his full potential."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352756",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(That was a calm and calculated answer. It's like she was talking about something entirely mundane... I don't know why, but I'm not buying it...)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352757",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(She makes it sound like the decision has everything to do with Childe and nothing to do with her. But, what does she actually feel about it?)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352758",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(The Abyss is completely silent. This domain must get lonely after a while. Not to mention, she said it's been hundreds of years since she arrived in Teyvat — and even longer than that if you account for how slowly time passes in here.)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352759",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Unlike you, I have no desire to establish a connection with the world. The weak and the lowly have no right to remember me. They're lucky they only have a few missing memories to show for it."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352760",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(In all that time, she never established a connection with this world. Was it really just because she looks down on the weak?)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352761",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(...I doubt she'd give me a straight answer if I asked. Besides, I already used up my three questions. She was happy to give me cold, hard facts. But, I still feel like I haven't heard her true \"voice.\")"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352762",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Wake up your companion. It's time to go."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "150352763",
                                                                    "speaker": "Skirk",
                                                                    "text": "Oh, and everything I just told you... Best keep it a secret from her as well."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "150352719",
                                                            "text": "That was a lot faster than I expected."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "150352709",
                                            "text": "So you're best friends now?"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "150352706",
                            "text": "Yeah, I'm starving."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}